WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.014 --> 00:00:02.383
[Music: ‘He’s a Black Flame Dragon’ theme song]

2
00:00:50.064 --> 00:00:52.181
{\an8}[Soft music]

3
00:00:55.102 --> 00:00:56.237
{\an8}[Juyeon and Sujeong’s embarrassed laughter]

4
00:01:02.227 --> 00:01:03.194
{\an8}(Juyeon) Then

5
00:01:04.429 --> 00:01:05.313
{\an8}Yes

6
00:01:06.331 --> 00:01:07.315
{\an8}Good luck

7
00:01:09.016 --> 00:01:11.185
{\an8}Yes, I will go in.

8
00:01:11.252 --> 00:01:12.119
{\an8}(Juyeon) Yes

9
00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:23.498
{\an8}[light smile]

10
00:01:40.432 --> 00:01:41.282
Why...

11
00:01:41.349 --> 00:01:42.783
When I think about it

12
00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:45.269
I think there's something I want to ask you.

13
00:01:45.336 --> 00:01:47.088
Really? What is it?

14
00:01:48.073 --> 00:01:50.975
But let's talk about it here
Just a little bit

15
00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:53.027
Shall we take a walk?

16
00:01:53.094 --> 00:01:54.095
(Juyeon) I love it so much

17
00:01:54.846 --> 00:01:55.896
Ask me anything

18
00:01:55.963 --> 00:01:57.198
I'll answer anything

19
00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.400
[Calm music]
[Sound of grass bugs crying]

20
00:02:08.821 --> 00:02:10.378
That's what I want to ask...

21
00:02:11.868 --> 00:02:12.780
Ah!

22
00:02:14.015 --> 00:02:15.065
(Edit) Uh...

23
00:02:16.951 --> 00:02:19.254
Oh, what should I do with my luggage, Director?

24
00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:22.106
Once in my room
I left it in the attic

25
00:02:22.173 --> 00:02:24.542
Even if it’s a separate room
Shouldn’t I save it?

26
00:02:25.443 --> 00:02:26.377
(Juyeon) Well, I don’t know.

27
00:02:26.994 --> 00:02:28.762
If I sign a contract in my name

28
00:02:28.829 --> 00:02:30.564
Because the Chairman may know

29
00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:33.848
(Edited) Ah, I guess so.

30
00:02:37.489 --> 00:02:39.691
If it's okay, can I just leave it alone?

31
00:02:40.575 --> 00:02:42.577
I can trust it because it's Baek Soo-jeong's house.

32
00:02:44.278 --> 00:02:45.713
I look at your face as an excuse

33
00:02:47.515 --> 00:02:49.216
[laughter]
[Juyeon’s light smile]

34
00:02:54.188 --> 00:02:55.957
[Exciting music]

35
00:03:02.964 --> 00:03:05.566
(Edited) That kind of thing
Doing it shamelessly and well

36
00:03:07.869 --> 00:03:09.570
[Sujeong’s light smile]
[Juyeon chuckles]

37
00:03:11.734 --> 00:03:12.773
[Juyeon clears his throat]

38
00:03:24.102 --> 00:03:24.986
(Edited) Then

39
00:03:25.609 --> 00:03:26.777
I'll go in

40
00:03:30.444 --> 00:03:31.345
(Juyeon) Me too

41
00:03:32.944 --> 00:03:34.445
I also have something to ask

42
00:03:35.446 --> 00:03:36.797
Really?
[light laughter]

43
00:03:37.465 --> 00:03:38.333
yes

44
00:03:38.966 --> 00:03:40.968
[lively music]

45
00:03:46.741 --> 00:03:49.276
What do you want to ask?

46
00:03:49.343 --> 00:03:50.378
(Juyeon) Ah!

47
00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.349
With that older sister
Do you think they are very close?

48
00:03:55.983 --> 00:03:57.017
Jjin’s sister?

49
00:03:57.084 --> 00:03:59.920
(Sujeong) We’ve been close since we were young.
I met you in a game

50
00:04:02.557 --> 00:04:04.225
The game where you met your first love?

51
00:04:05.259 --> 00:04:06.794
[Laughing awkwardly] Oh, yes.

52
00:04:11.065 --> 00:04:12.500
What's the name of the game?
[surprised sound effect]

53
00:04:12.567 --> 00:04:14.207
[upbeat music]

54
00:04:19.574 --> 00:04:20.541
[Juyeon clears his throat awkwardly]

55
00:04:23.367 --> 00:04:25.200
[Sigh of relief]
[Humorous sound effects]

56
00:04:25.267 --> 00:04:26.347
[Embarrassed laughter]

57
00:04:29.868 --> 00:04:31.868
[lively music]

58
00:04:41.796 --> 00:04:45.466
The head of the department is Director Kim Shin-won.
Are you friendly?

59
00:04:45.533 --> 00:04:46.867
Yes, Mom's friend...
[motorcycle horn sound]

60
00:04:46.934 --> 00:04:48.133
[Sound effect bouncing]

61
00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.204
[humorous music]

62
00:04:51.973 --> 00:04:53.708
Oh, are you okay?

63
00:04:54.642 --> 00:04:55.943
(Modified) Motorcycle

64
00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:57.345
(Juyeon) Yes, well...

65
00:04:58.379 --> 00:05:00.081
[Juyeon and Sujeong’s embarrassed laughter]

66
00:05:03.351 --> 00:05:04.818
[lively music]
(Juyeon) Anyway

67
00:05:04.885 --> 00:05:06.885
Since I was young too
We knew each other

68
00:05:07.939 --> 00:05:09.824
(Edited) Ah, that’s right.

69
00:05:11.125 --> 00:05:12.192
Wait a minute

70
00:05:13.027 --> 00:05:16.430
Then I had the director investigate.
Are you the general manager?

71
00:05:19.218 --> 00:05:20.901
There was nothing I could do at that time.

72
00:05:20.968 --> 00:05:22.867
Soo-jeong Baek knows too many of my secrets...
[surprised gasp]

73
00:05:22.934 --> 00:05:24.939
[humorous music]

74
00:05:25.006 --> 00:05:26.173
[Cat crying]

75
00:05:30.912 --> 00:05:31.910
Did you go?

76
00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.281
[Eye blinking sound effect]

77
00:05:34.348 --> 00:05:35.182
yes

78
00:05:35.249 --> 00:05:36.851
gone, cat

79
00:05:39.153 --> 00:05:40.654
Oh, was it a cat?

80
00:05:46.167 --> 00:05:47.094
[light laughter]

81
00:05:50.731 --> 00:05:52.299
Was it a bit overdone?

82
00:05:52.366 --> 00:05:53.434
[Soft music]
(Juyeon) Kinda?

83
00:05:54.535 --> 00:05:57.205
In a neighborhood with few people
Is it really necessary to do this?

84
00:05:57.797 --> 00:06:01.809
I can meet my dad
There's nothing wrong with being careful.

85
00:06:01.876 --> 00:06:04.549
And if people at work catch you
It's a bigger problem

86
00:06:04.616 --> 00:06:06.051
(Edited) Well, are there just one or two people from the company?

87
00:06:06.655 --> 00:06:09.917
8,000 employees at headquarters alone
The number of affiliates combined is 100,000.

88
00:06:09.984 --> 00:06:13.053
When, where and how will it appear?
You don't know, do you?

89
00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.522
I was persuaded.

90
00:06:14.589 --> 00:06:15.556
Wait a minute

91
00:06:19.293 --> 00:06:20.427
[laughter]

92
00:06:21.796 --> 00:06:22.629
Let's go

93
00:06:22.696 --> 00:06:24.198
- (Edit) None?
- (Main lead) Yes

94
00:06:24.265 --> 00:06:25.366
[Juyeon chuckles]

95
00:06:32.106 --> 00:06:33.154
[Juyeon’s happy laughter]

96
00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:49.356
I really have to go now

97
00:06:50.625 --> 00:06:52.560
Take care, call me when you arrive.

98
00:06:53.294 --> 00:06:55.229
Yes, welcome in.

99
00:07:04.539 --> 00:07:06.400
(Juyeon) Ah
[Humorous sound effects]

100
00:07:06.467 --> 00:07:08.542
[Exciting music]

101
00:07:10.044 --> 00:07:10.911
[Boom sound effect]

102
00:07:14.634 --> 00:07:15.683
[light laughter]

103
00:07:21.255 --> 00:07:22.256
[shy laughter]

104
00:07:25.425 --> 00:07:26.760
[Soft music]

105
00:07:26.827 --> 00:07:28.028
(Juyeon) Ah!

106
00:07:28.095 --> 00:07:29.263
[Cheers from the main cast]

107
00:07:31.098 --> 00:07:32.099
[sound of a switch being pressed]

108
00:07:38.439 --> 00:07:39.540
(Edited) Piece?

109
00:07:41.142 --> 00:07:43.610
What does ‘rock and roll’ mean?
[cell phone vibrating sound]

110
00:07:49.948 --> 00:07:50.982
(main role)

111
00:07:51.934 --> 00:07:53.068
(Sujeong) I guess I’m crazy

112
00:07:53.921 --> 00:07:55.534
(main role)

113
00:07:55.601 --> 00:07:56.657
[Happy laughter]

114
00:07:58.159 --> 00:07:59.226
Anyway

115
00:07:59.293 --> 00:08:01.350
I heard you have a talent for making people laugh.

116
00:08:09.804 --> 00:08:11.804
[Soft Music-Continued]

117
00:08:15.743 --> 00:08:16.937
[cell phone vibrating sound]

118
00:08:28.434 --> 00:08:31.191
[Juyeon’s happy laughter]

119
00:08:35.963 --> 00:08:37.164
[Screen transition sound effect]
[Awkward elasticity]

120
00:08:37.732 --> 00:08:39.800
I have a knack for driving people crazy.

121
00:08:39.867 --> 00:08:41.867
[Sound of grass bugs crying]

122
00:08:44.005 --> 00:08:45.089
(Hyunggeun) Hey there

123
00:08:45.156 --> 00:08:47.400
Yes, sir, do you need anything?

124
00:08:47.467 --> 00:08:48.943
Uh, alcohol, water, snacks?

125
00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.830
[Elegant music plays]
Not like that

126
00:08:53.614 --> 00:08:55.216
Can I have the boss's number?

127
00:08:56.334 --> 00:08:57.235
yes?

128
00:08:58.886 --> 00:09:00.655
I'd like to see you outside

129
00:09:06.794 --> 00:09:07.695
(Hajin) Ah!

130
00:09:10.064 --> 00:09:12.266
That might be difficult, sir.

131
00:09:13.329 --> 00:09:14.552
Why?

132
00:09:14.619 --> 00:09:15.910
Because I'm a guest?

133
00:09:15.977 --> 00:09:18.405
no
It doesn't matter if the guest is a guest.

134
00:09:19.173 --> 00:09:20.274
Just...

135
00:09:20.341 --> 00:09:21.342
I'm not attracted to you

136
00:09:21.932 --> 00:09:23.844
[humorous music]
Oh, you’re not attracted to me?

137
00:09:23.911 --> 00:09:27.648
(Hajin) Yes, then not the number.
Please call me again if you need anything else.

138
00:09:35.389 --> 00:09:37.657
[Car horn sounds]

139
00:09:37.724 --> 00:09:39.526
[Classical music plays]

140
00:09:39.994 --> 00:09:40.961
[camera shutter sound]

141
00:09:41.662 --> 00:09:42.696
[cell phone vibrating sound]

142
00:10:01.032 --> 00:10:02.649
There really is nothing to do anymore, right?

143
00:10:09.106 --> 00:10:10.157
(Classmate 1) Kim Shin-won!

144
00:10:11.375 --> 00:10:12.359
It's been a while

145
00:10:12.426 --> 00:10:15.538
(Shinwon) Uh, our last reunion was
Was this the last time you saw him?

146
00:10:16.264 --> 00:10:18.165
(Classmate 1) Did you come alone? What about your girlfriend?

147
00:10:18.232 --> 00:10:19.366
Oh, girlfriend?

148
00:10:20.318 --> 00:10:21.752
It's been a while since we broke up

149
00:10:21.819 --> 00:10:23.204
(Classmate 1) How many hours has it been?

150
00:10:23.271 --> 00:10:24.839
Has 24 hours passed?

151
00:10:24.906 --> 00:10:25.906
The joke is

152
00:10:26.374 --> 00:10:27.941
- I need this
- (Classmate 2) Yes

153
00:10:32.894 --> 00:10:33.948
(Motivator 1) Did you hear what I said?

154
00:10:34.015 --> 00:10:35.015
Hajin

155
00:10:35.082 --> 00:10:37.251
I divorced my husband because he cheated on me.
[Motivator 2’s surprised gasp]

156
00:10:37.318 --> 00:10:38.953
(Motivator 3) Hey, this is crazy, is it really true?

157
00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:41.000
I didn't see that senior that way.

158
00:10:41.067 --> 00:10:43.240
Oh, you've been CC with Hajin since you were a freshman.

159
00:10:43.307 --> 00:10:44.267
(Motivation 1) So

160
00:10:44.334 --> 00:10:45.576
I don't know about people

161
00:10:45.643 --> 00:10:47.594
What should I do because I feel sorry for you?

162
00:10:47.661 --> 00:10:48.778
Am I okay?

163
00:10:48.845 --> 00:10:50.531
- (Motivator 2) Ha Jin-ah
- (Hajin) You came early.

164
00:10:50.598 --> 00:10:51.832
(Motivator 3) Hey

165
00:10:51.899 --> 00:10:54.018
I heard about your husband

166
00:10:54.085 --> 00:10:55.870
Are you really okay?

167
00:10:55.937 --> 00:10:57.671
Uh, it's okay

168
00:10:57.738 --> 00:11:01.042
Ah, I was angry at first.
After getting divorced, I lost all my grades.

169
00:11:01.726 --> 00:11:02.709
(Motivation 2) Ha Jin-ah

170
00:11:02.776 --> 00:11:04.512
(Motivation 1) What is okay?

171
00:11:04.579 --> 00:11:06.351
You don't have to act in front of us

172
00:11:06.418 --> 00:11:07.647
(Motivator 2) That’s right.

173
00:11:07.714 --> 00:11:09.180
Oh, is it true?

174
00:11:09.247 --> 00:11:10.767
Is divorce common?

175
00:11:10.834 --> 00:11:14.321
(Motivation 3) Mr., those adulterous things
You have to dry up that seed, really.

176
00:11:14.388 --> 00:11:15.801
Hey, stop him.
[Hajin laughs]

177
00:11:15.868 --> 00:11:16.974
[Party 2 laughs]
(Motivator 3) Hey...

178
00:11:17.041 --> 00:11:18.792
[Motivator 3’s unfair exclamation]
(Hajin) Let’s go, it’s late, it’s late

179
00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:31.505
[Soft music]

180
00:11:31.572 --> 00:11:32.506
(Hajin) Huh?

181
00:11:33.107 --> 00:11:34.241
Are we meeting here again?

182
00:11:38.267 --> 00:11:39.179
[light laughter]

183
00:11:42.864 --> 00:11:44.118
Would you like to eat candy together?

184
00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:47.674
[Shinwon and Hajin laugh]

185
00:11:58.399 --> 00:12:00.901
(Shinwon) I happened to see this somewhere like this...

186
00:12:00.968 --> 00:12:01.969
(Hajin) Does it feel like fate?

187
00:12:02.868 --> 00:12:05.873
[Shinwon and Hajin laugh]

188
00:12:05.940 --> 00:12:06.874
(Shinwon) Yes

189
00:12:08.526 --> 00:12:10.344
No, among friends

190
00:12:10.411 --> 00:12:12.613
It was frustrating to be told to get married.

191
00:12:13.414 --> 00:12:15.582
So it came up like this
Hajin is perfect

192
00:12:16.133 --> 00:12:17.468
Because it's like this, why?

193
00:12:17.535 --> 00:12:18.552
I guess?

194
00:12:18.619 --> 00:12:21.522
Oh, I came up because I was frustrated too.

195
00:12:21.589 --> 00:12:22.556
Why?

196
00:12:23.024 --> 00:12:25.126
Do your friends want to marry Hajin too?

197
00:12:25.193 --> 00:12:26.352
[Hajin’s absurd laughter]

198
00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:29.230
No, to someone who recently divorced.
Who said that?

199
00:12:29.297 --> 00:12:31.532
Oh, that's right, right?
[Hajin’s laughter]

200
00:12:37.305 --> 00:12:38.839
With my ex-husband

201
00:12:39.406 --> 00:12:43.543
[Calm music]
We met for over 10 years, starting when we were freshmen, and then got married.

202
00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:45.647
(Shinwon) Um, we’ve been together for a long time?

203
00:12:47.398 --> 00:12:49.099
Because I've known you for a long time

204
00:12:49.166 --> 00:12:52.619
I thought I knew it well
I guess marriage was different again.

205
00:12:53.888 --> 00:12:56.389
In less than half a year
You've cheated, right?

206
00:12:56.456 --> 00:12:58.200
I follow myself
I followed you to the countryside.

207
00:12:58.267 --> 00:12:59.527
Hey, that's trash.

208
00:12:59.594 --> 00:13:00.494
So!

209
00:13:02.463 --> 00:13:03.530
(Hajin) That trash bastard

210
00:13:04.432 --> 00:13:07.000
After I cleaned it up in front of my eyes
I was really okay?

211
00:13:07.902 --> 00:13:10.171
But everyone is wondering how I'm okay?

212
00:13:10.771 --> 00:13:12.589
Should I at least pretend to be okay?

213
00:13:14.058 --> 00:13:15.509
(Shinwon) What are you doing?

214
00:13:15.576 --> 00:13:16.843
It's really okay

215
00:13:17.345 --> 00:13:18.279
(Hajin) So

216
00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.981
I wish you could trust me like Shinwon.

217
00:13:23.184 --> 00:13:24.785
(Shinwon) I was frustrated about that too.

218
00:13:26.003 --> 00:13:27.738
I was sincere

219
00:13:28.623 --> 00:13:30.390
Everyone said I didn't mean it.

220
00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:34.729
Shinwon’s heart is
Shinwon would know best.

221
00:13:35.696 --> 00:13:36.897
So

222
00:13:37.698 --> 00:13:39.166
How do I feel?

223
00:13:40.201 --> 00:13:41.736
I know best

224
00:13:46.741 --> 00:13:48.108
I really

225
00:13:51.078 --> 00:13:52.879
I always meant it.

226
00:13:52.946 --> 00:13:54.946
[Calm music - continued]

227
00:14:04.934 --> 00:14:06.893
[Sound of grass bugs crying]

228
00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:30.817
Do you want to sleep with me?

229
00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:37.544
(Shinwon) You did that last time, right?

230
00:14:38.826 --> 00:14:40.861
I think I can sleep one more time

231
00:14:42.129 --> 00:14:43.764
I have no intention of dating seriously

232
00:14:45.216 --> 00:14:46.183
Is that still the case?

233
00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:47.951
If I say yes, does that mean I refuse?

234
00:14:48.018 --> 00:14:49.836
yes, no

235
00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.308
[Soft music]

236
00:15:00.218 --> 00:15:02.249
What if I reject it and then accept it?

237
00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:03.984
I have to push it out

238
00:15:04.919 --> 00:15:06.720
You should be able to push it away

239
00:15:08.823 --> 00:15:10.257
Do you like me that much?

240
00:15:12.593 --> 00:15:13.928
(Hajin) It won’t work.

241
00:15:15.179 --> 00:15:16.713
You need to meet me

242
00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:17.882
seriously

243
00:15:21.473 --> 00:15:22.869
Follow me again

244
00:15:25.239 --> 00:15:26.206
Don't like it?

245
00:15:30.317 --> 00:15:31.278
Good

246
00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:33.613
Because I like it

247
00:15:45.167 --> 00:15:47.167
[bird chirping]

248
00:15:53.467 --> 00:15:54.534
[surprised gasp]

249
00:15:57.167 --> 00:15:58.873
[Welcome laughter]

250
00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:00.996
(Edited) You said you were going to a meeting. How did you get there?

251
00:16:01.843 --> 00:16:03.267
It's time to go see your face.

252
00:16:03.334 --> 00:16:04.228
[light laughter]

253
00:16:04.295 --> 00:16:05.246
Isn't the car blocked?

254
00:16:05.313 --> 00:16:07.013
Yes, it came easily.

255
00:16:07.548 --> 00:16:08.915
[Happy laughter]
[Wonseop’s tired sigh]

256
00:16:10.057 --> 00:16:11.218
Ah, Sujeong-ah

257
00:16:11.285 --> 00:16:13.052
[Sound effect of turning around]
(Wonseop) When do you come out of the house...

258
00:16:13.119 --> 00:16:14.622
[Interesting music]
Director?

259
00:16:14.689 --> 00:16:15.689
[surprised sound effect]

260
00:16:17.968 --> 00:16:20.060
(Edited) Ah, Dad

261
00:16:22.729 --> 00:16:23.963
